sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Package host
    participant P as Owned helper
    participant B as Host broker
    participant S as Store and registry
    H->>P: Initialize with nonce, versions, features and manifest digest
    P-->>H: Selected protocol and declared inventory
    Note over H,P: Startup has no invocation grants
    H->>S: Verify staged package and committed registry generation
    H->>P: Activate committed registry and state
    H->>P: Invoke with scoped token, input and revision view
    P->>B: Broker callback with stable action key
    B->>B: Check current token, selected operation, schema and controls
    B->>S: Durable admission or existing operation receipt
    S-->>B: Actual accepted state
    H->>B: Revoke new callback admission for cancellation
    H->>P: Cancel original invocation
    P-->>H: Cancellation request acknowledged
    Note over H,P: Acknowledgment is separate from terminal outcome
    B-->>P: Late observation of already admitted callback
    P-->>H: Terminal outcome with retained uncertainty
    H->>S: Record observations and reconcile effects
    Note over H,S: New registry waits for quiescence and compatibility
    H->>P: Activate a later committed generation
    Note over P,B: Old tokens and generations cannot authorize new effects
